sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant C as CloudFront (stated)
    participant A as ALB (stated)
    participant G as Gateway
    B->>C: Viewer request (HTTPS setting unverified)
    C->>A: Origin request (HTTP/HTTPS policy unverified)
    A->>G: Forward to Gateway target group
    G-->>A: Application response
    A-->>C: Origin response
    C-->>B: Viewer response
